			<item>
				<title>A Barca Virou</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_barca_virou/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_barca_virou/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;lirycs&#34;&gt;Lirycs&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(mulher)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A barca virou&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Deixa-la virar&lt;br&gt;&#xA;São voltas que dão&lt;br&gt;&#xA;No fundo do mar&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CORO&lt;/em&gt; &lt;strong&gt;– repetir quadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ó compadre tombou um carro&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Lá para as bandas de São Mateus&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ó comadre eu vou-me embora&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ó compadre adeus adeus&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(mulher)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Tombou ai lé&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Deixa-la tombar&lt;br&gt;&#xA;São voltas que dão&lt;br&gt;&#xA;E tornam a dar&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;&lt;summary&gt;Show English translation&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(woman)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;The little boat turned over&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Let her turn&lt;br&gt;&#xA;They are turns that take place&lt;br&gt;&#xA;at the bottom of the sea&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>A Lavadeira</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_lavadeira/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_lavadeira/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;lirycs&#34;&gt;Lirycs&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(mulher)&lt;/em&gt; &lt;strong&gt;– repete cada 2 versos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;O pedreiro cheira a cal&lt;br&gt;&#xA;O carpinteiro a madeira&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Cada qual o seu ofício&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Eu também sou lavadeira&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CORO (MULHERES)&lt;/em&gt; &lt;strong&gt;- repete cada 2 versos&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#xA;Eu também sou lavadeira&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Lá no rio de Jordão&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Lavo saias entermeios&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Também lavo o meu calção &lt;em&gt;(HOMENS)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(homem)&lt;/em&gt; &lt;strong&gt;- repete cada 2 versos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Também lavo o meu calção&lt;br&gt;&#xA;E o vosso pé delicado&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Esse corpinho bem feito&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Já cá era desejado&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Aqui Está Quem Brinca Brinca</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-aqui_esta_quem_brinca_brinca/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-aqui_esta_quem_brinca_brinca/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;lirycs&#34;&gt;Lirycs&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(mulher)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Se o mar tivesse varandas&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Nem que elas fossem de pau&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ia ver o meu amor&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Na pesca do bacalhau&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CORO&lt;/em&gt; &lt;strong&gt;– repete a quadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Aqui está quem brinca brinca&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Aqui está quem brinca bem&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Aqui está quem tem amores&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Aqui está quem os não tem&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(homem)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ó mar alto ó mar alto&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ó mar alto sem ter fundo&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Mais vale andar no mar alto&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Do que nas bocas do mundo&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Canioneiro dos Moleiros da Ribeira do Olival</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This collection is currently incomplete, since most songs were not transcribed into sheet music and none of them were in a digital format, so since 2024 I embarked on the project to transcribe all the songs known in the group into digital sheet music in order to preserve them.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m going to be updating this page as I transcribe more songs.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_barca_virou&#34;&gt;A Barca Virou&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_lavadeira&#34;&gt;A Lavadeira&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-aqui_esta_quem_brinca_brinca&#34;&gt;Aqui Está Quem Brinca Brinca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Cantemos Dancemos</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-cantemos_dancemos/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-cantemos_dancemos/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;lirycs&#34;&gt;Lirycs&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(mulher)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Minha mãe é minha amiga&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Gosta de me ver briosa&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Tira os brincos das orelhas&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Enfeita-te ó minha rosa&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CORO&lt;/em&gt; &lt;strong&gt;– repete 1.ª quadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Cantemos dancemos&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Nossa linda moda&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Cantemos dancemos&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Venham para a roda&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Cantemos dancemos&lt;br&gt;&#xA;É nossa alegria&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Cantemos dancemos&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Nesta romaria&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(homem)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Eu amei-te foi um sonho&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Deixei-te foi falsidade&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Foi enquanto não achei&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Amores á minha vontade&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;&lt;summary&gt;Show English translation&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not Available&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;sheet-music&#34;&gt;Sheet music&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/sheets/Cantemos Dancemos_versão-simplificada.pdf&#34; width=&#34;600px&#34; height=&#34;900px&#34; style=&#34;border: none; border-radius: 8px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/sheets/Cantemos Dancemos_versão-simplificada.pdf&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;audio controls&gt;&#xA;  &lt;source src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/mp3/Cantemos Dancemos_versão-simplificada.mp3&#34; type=&#34;audio/mpeg&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Your browser does not support the audio element. &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/mp3/Cantemos Dancemos_versão-simplificada.mp3&#34;&gt;Download the audio&lt;/a&gt; instead.&#xA;&lt;/audio&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Dança a Quatro Passos</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-danca_a_quatro_passos/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-danca_a_quatro_passos/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This song is not danced in just 4 different steps, but that is the actual translation. It does not have any lirycs, although not without any meaning, we use it to mimic how they used to start the dance floor.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;sheet-music&#34;&gt;Sheet music&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/sheets/Dança a Quatro Passos_versão-simplificada.pdf&#34; width=&#34;600px&#34; height=&#34;900px&#34; style=&#34;border: none; border-radius: 8px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/sheets/Dança a Quatro Passos_versão-simplificada.pdf&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;audio controls&gt;&#xA;  &lt;source src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/mp3/Dança a Quatro Passos_versão-simplificada.mp3&#34; type=&#34;audio/mpeg&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Your browser does not support the audio element. &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/mp3/song.mp3&#34;&gt;Download the audio&lt;/a&gt; instead.&#xA;&lt;/audio&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Fado da Rica Prima</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-fado_da_rica_prima/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-fado_da_rica_prima/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;lyrics&#34;&gt;Lyrics&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(homem)&lt;/em&gt; &lt;strong&gt;– repete cada 2 versos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ajuda-me ó cantadeira&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A cantar ao menos uma&lt;br&gt;&#xA;No cantar e no bailar, rica prima agora e logo&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Não há desonra nenhuma&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(mulher)&lt;/em&gt; &lt;strong&gt;– repete cada 2 versos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Canto eu que sou casada &lt;br&gt;&#xA;As solteiras têm primor&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Levam-se na opinião, rica prima agora e logo&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Não as enjeite o amor&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(homem)&lt;/em&gt; &lt;strong&gt;– repete cada 2 versos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ó amor adeus amor&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ó amor não tens a ninguém&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Amas a quem te não ama, rica prima agora e logo&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Desprezas quem te quer bem.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
